- **Desktop App**: `/Users/youngs/.gemini/extensions/bkit/skills/desktop-app/SKILL.md`
- **Enterprise**: `/Users/youngs/.gemini/extensions/bkit/skills/enterprise/SKILL.md`
- **Dynamic Web**: `/Users/youngs/.gemini/extensions/bkit/skills/dynamic/SKILL.md`
- **Deployment**: `/Users/youngs/.gemini/extensions/bkit/skills/phase-9-deployment/SKILL.md`
